# Nullapart reinjection header_checks — evidence boundary for the private
# reinjection listener (10026).
#
# Reinjection deliberately runs with smtpd_milters disabled (loop prevention:
# mailcore-filter must never re-run on reinjected mail). Because no Rspamd
# milter strips evidence headers on this path, Postfix strips them here so a
# message reinjected from Mail Core can never carry stale or forged spam
# evidence into the queue. The after-queue mailcore-filter reads X-Rspamd-*
# evidence only from messages that passed the public SMTP listener's Rspamd
# milter strip+re-add chain.

/^X-Spam: /                 IGNORE
/^X-Spam-Score: /           IGNORE
/^X-Spam-Status: /          IGNORE
/^X-Spam-Action: /          IGNORE
/^X-Spam-Flag: /            IGNORE
/^X-Spam-Check: /           IGNORE
/^X-Rspamd-/                IGNORE
/^X-Nullapart-Spam-/        IGNORE
